  <Item id="eb5dc796-da6d-546a-9638-4b02dca72e99" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+40%">Safety Plan — Rear PTO control system (PTO-ECU 200)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Project-specific safety plan per ISO 25119-1:2018, 6.4.6.3 and Annex A. It binds every department involved in the T6100 rear PTO development at Ager Dynamics S.L. and is subject to version and change management (ISO 25119-4:2018, Clause 11).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="ID">
      <Value>PTO-PLN-000</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Responsible" />
    <Attribute name="Due" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="0" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="daf078f2-6e01-5a72-a171-b820e8231291" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">1. Objective and scope</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Develop the rear PTO control system as SRP/CS to EN ISO 25119 with the AgPL determined by the HARA (highest: AgPL d for unintended engagement). The plan covers concept, series development, validation, assessment and release; production and operation planning are handed to manufacturing per Part 4.</Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>A machine-level risk assessment per ISO 12100 exists for the T6100 platform (document MRA-T6100-04, not part of this UoO) and is the prerequisite for this SRP/CS development.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="ID">
      <Value>PTO-PLN-001</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Responsible">
      <Value>E. Vidal</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Due" />
    <Attribute name="Status" value="2" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="1dace388-bbb9-5a89-b080-194be592e524" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">2. Project safety organisation</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Table><Column width="230.00"/><Column width="150.00"/><Column width="260.00"/><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">Role</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">Name</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text bold="true">Qualification</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Project safety manager (FSM)</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Elena Vidal</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>8 y functional safety (25119/13849), TÜV FS Eng</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Systems engineering</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Henrik Larsen</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Tractor driveline systems, 12 y</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Hardware lead</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Paolo Ferraro</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Power electronics, EMC, 9 y</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Software lead</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Claire Moreau</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Embedded C, MISRA, SRL 2 projects</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Verification &amp; validation</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Tomasz Kowal</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>HIL + machine test, 7 y</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Independent assessor (U3)</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Greta Hoffmann</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>External, accident investigation background</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Field test</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Callum Reid</Text></Paragraph></Cell><Cell><Paragraph alignment="Left"><Text>Working farmer + test engineer</Text></Paragraph></Cell></Row></Table>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
